#==============================================================================================
#
#   sk_path_contains - SkPath::contains: point-in-path by winding numbers
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Skia m144 src/core/SkPathPriv.cpp lines 884-1370 (poly_eval, between,
#       eval_cubic_pts, find_minmax, checkOnCurve, the winding_* counters for lines, quads,
#       conics and cubics, the tangent_* collectors and SkPathPriv::Contains) and
#       src/core/SkPath.cpp:547 (SkPath::contains, which needs a finite path). Points on the
#       path's edges count as inside, with coincident edges cancelled by their tangents.
#
